<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55044" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρρίπτ-ω</span></b>  (later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρριπτ-ριπτέω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Man.
			4.288
		</span></i>:—
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταρειπτούμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(3).325.41
				</span></i>
			 (Thera, <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>), also pf.
			part.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατηρειμμένος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				326.20
			</span></i>), <i>throw down, overthrow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ τε δημόθρους ἀναρχία βουλὴν
					καταρρίψειεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					884
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ βασίλεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Luc.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Salt.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τοὺς πολεμίους</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαίρω</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
				7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bring into disrepute</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μάθησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					238.31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>despise</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξαν, ἔπαινον</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				13.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i>.</div>
